       SLEEP-TIMER.
0001DE     CALL "C$SLEEP" USING 2.

       ADD-USER.
0001ED     PERFORM UNTIL 1 = 2
0001F6                     MOVE CURRENT-DATE TO MASTER-START-DATE
0001FD         MOVE 0417 TO CURSOR-POS
000203         DISPLAY DISPLAY-RECORD
00025F         ACCEPT DISPLAY-RECORD
0002B8             ON EXCEPTION EXIT PERFORM
               END-ACCEPT
0002BC         PERFORM VALIDATE-DATA
0002C0                     IF VALID-DATA
0002C9                             INITIALIZE YES-NO
0002CE                             DISPLAY "ARE YOU SURE YOU WANT TO ADD THE RECORD? Y/N" AT 2420 ERASE LINE
0002D7             ACCEPT YES-NO AT 2465
0002E2             IF YES-NO = "Y" OR "y"
0002F3                 MOVE WS-MASTER-ACCOUNT TO MASTER-ACCOUNT
0002F9                 MOVE WS-MASTER-BALANCE TO MASTER-BALANCE
0002FF                 PERFORM WRITE-DATA
000303                 EXIT PERFORM
00030A             ELSE
